  B("আমি তোমার সাথে একমত।",["I agree with you.","I am agree with you.","I agree to you.","I am agreeing you."],"I agree with you.","Agree with + person."),
  C("Your boss suggests Friday. You partly agree.","I agree up to a ___ , but Friday is busy for the clients.",["point","level","limit","part"],"point","Fixed phrase: up to a point."),
  F("Pick the most natural reply to 'We should start earlier.'",["Yes, correct.","Absolutely. That would give us more time.","You are right, obviously.","Agreed is me."],"Absolutely. That would give us more time.","Agree + a reason."),
